<section class="mx-auto flex max-w-4xl flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white dark:border-gray-800 dark:bg-white/[0.03]">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-gray-100 px-5 py-4 dark:border-gray-800">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-500 dark:bg-brand-500/15 dark:text-brand-400">
                <partial name="_Icon" model="@("components")" />
            </span>
            <div>
                <h3 class="text-theme-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-white/90">AI 助手</h3>
                <p class="text-theme-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">GPT-4o · 已就緒</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-theme-xs font-medium text-gray-700 shadow-theme-xs hover:bg-gray-50 dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:text-gray-400"
                onclick="Ta.toast.success('已開始新對話（演示）')">新對話</button>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-5 px-5 py-6">
        <div class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-50 text-brand-500 dark:bg-brand-500/15 dark:text-brand-400">
                <partial name="_Icon" model="@("components")" />
            </span>
            <div class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-tl-md bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-theme-sm leading-6 text-gray-700 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-300">
                你好，我是你的運營助手。可以幫你分析銷售數據、生成商品文案，或整理客服回覆。今天想先做什麼？
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex justify-end">
            <div class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-tr-md bg-brand-500 px-4 py-3 text-theme-sm leading-6 text-white">
                幫我總結上月銷售表現，並給三條優化建議。
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-3">
            <span class="flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-50 text-brand-500 dark:bg-brand-500/15 dark:text-brand-400">
                <partial name="_Icon" model="@("components")" />
            </span>
            <div class="max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-tl-md bg-gray-50 px-4 py-3 text-theme-sm leading-6 text-gray-700 dark:bg-white/5 dark:text-gray-300">
                <p>上月銷售額較前月增長 8.6%，主要由數碼品類拉動；退貨率下降 1.2 個百分點，客單價基本持平。</p>
                <p class="mt-2 font-medium text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-200">三條建議：</p>
                <ul class="mt-1 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
                    <li>加大數碼品類的庫存與首頁曝光，抓住增長窗口。</li>
                    <li>對高退貨 SKU 補充尺寸與材質說明，繼續壓低退貨率。</li>
                    <li>針對沉睡用戶發放限時券，提升復購與客單價。</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-gray-100 px-5 py-4 dark:border-gray-800">
        <div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-gray-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-xs text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:border-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-white/5"
                    onclick="Ta.toast.info('已插入提示詞（演示）')">生成商品文案</button>
            <button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-gray-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-xs text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:border-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-white/5"
                    onclick="Ta.toast.info('已插入提示詞（演示）')">分析轉化漏斗</button>
            <button type="button" class="rounded-full border border-gray-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-theme-xs text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:border-gray-700 dark:text-gray-400 dark:hover:bg-white/5"
                    onclick="Ta.toast.info('已插入提示詞（演示）')">整理客服回覆</button>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-end gap-3">
            <textarea rows="2" placeholder="輸入你的問題…"
                      class="w-full rounded-xl border border-gray-300 bg-transparent px-4 py-3 text-theme-sm text-gray-800 shadow-theme-xs transition-colors placeholder:text-gray-400 focus:border-brand-300 focus:ring-3 focus:ring-brand-500/20 focus:outline-hidden dark:border-gray-700 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-white/90 dark:placeholder:text-white/30 dark:focus:border-brand-800"></textarea>
            <button type="button" class="inline-flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500 text-white shadow-theme-xs hover:bg-brand-600"
                    onclick="Ta.toast.success('已發送（演示）')" aria-label="發送">
                <partial name="_Icon" model="@("chevron-right")" />
            </button>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-2 text-center text-theme-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-500">AI 生成的內容僅供參考，請人工核對後再使用。</p>
    </div>
</section>
